   "briefTitle": "Comparison Between Symbicort® and Prednisolone in COPD",
   "officialTitle": "A Randomised, Double Blind, Double Dummy, Multicentre Phase III Study Comparing the Efficacy of Budesonide/Formoterol (Symbicort® Forte Turbuhaler®) and Oral Prednisolone + Formoterol (Oxis® Turbuhaler) During Two Weeks, in COPD Patients With an Acute Exacerbation, Followed by Twelve Weeks Open Follow up Period With Budesonide/Formoterol (Symbicort Forte Turbuhaler)",
